RULE                       DEFAULT  SUMMARY
invalid-rule               error    Rule file or rule cannot be parsed
paging-missing-for         error    Paging alert has no for: duration
short-for                  warning  for: is shorter than the configured minimum
missing-runbook-url        error    No runbook_url annotation (or it is not a URL)
missing-summary            error    No summary annotation
missing-description        warning  No description annotation
missing-severity           error    No severity label
unknown-severity           error    Severity value is not in the allowed list
missing-owner-label        warning  No team/owner label
cause-based-paging         warning  Paging alert fires on a resource cause (CPU, memory, disk)
rate-window-too-short      error    rate()/increase() window shorter than N x scrape interval
high-cardinality-grouping  warning  Paging alert aggregates by a high-cardinality label
duplicate-alert            error    Same alert name and identical labels defined twice
unknown-directive          warning  Inline directive names a rule that does not exist

missing-runbook-url and missing-summary are errors on paging alerts and warnings otherwise.
Docs: https://github.com/mohammed-saaduddin-ansari/alert-linter#rules
